    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.icons\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12.x\n\n### Description\n\nThe `doc/tags` file of `mini.nvim`, which contains helptags for this plugin, is not ignored in a `.gitignore` file:\n\n```\n$ git status\nHEAD detached at v0.18.0\nUntracked files:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to include in what will be committed)\n        doc/tags\n\nnothing added to commit but untracked files present (use \"git add\" to track)\n$ cat .gitignore\ncat: .gitignore: No such file or directory\n```\n\nIn mini repository, it is ignored:\n\n```\n$ cat ../mini/.gitignore \ndoc/tags\ndual\n.nvim.lua\nSession.vim\n```\n\nCreating a PR in the mini.icons repository is restricted to collaborators, so I can't send a PR.\n\n### Reproduction\n\n* Install <https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.icons>\n* Run `:helptags ALL` in nvim\n* Notice `doc/tags` was created in the `mini.icons` repository and is not git-ignored",
